# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# probes/oc: make report could never finish. Four files, one root cause.
#
# Apply from the repo root with:  git apply -p1 probes/oc/report_fix/oc-report-fix.patch
# or with:                         patch -p1 < probes/oc/report_fix/oc-report-fix.patch
#
# WHY: probes/oc/oc_report.py loads cells_0.bin .. cells_31.bin (B=32) with no
# discovery. The `cells` target emitted 9 files (seeds 0..7 + 12345) and
# .gitignore documented a third set (0 1 2 3 12345). Nothing checked that the
# producer and the consumer agreed, so `make report` died with
#   FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'cells_8.bin'
# on every machine from a clean checkout. B=32 is the published config
# (notes/01: 170 MB region buffer = 32*1,327,976*4 = 169.98 MB), so the recipe
# was under-producing and the report was right. See notes/11-local-suite-integrity.md.
#
# 1. probes/oc/Makefile      NENVS becomes one number, the recipe proves it
#                            produced what the report needs, SEEDS_CSV is derived.
# 2. probes/oc/oc_report.py  B from $OC_B; one fixture dir for parent and
#                            subprocess; preflight; ref.bin shape check; claims
#                            derived from the counts; --b-sweep measures the
#                            flat-wall claim notes/01 publishes but nothing backed.
# 3. .gitignore              the third seed list, replaced by 'make cells'.
# 4. kernels/pack.py         its '23 MB of regenerable data' figure is stale.
#
# VERIFIED (Metal, this Mac): patched Makefile + patched report on a clean tree
# with no fixtures, no ref_oc, no ref.bin -> make report rc=0, full report.
# The 9 pre-existing fixtures are sha256-identical to fresh output. 33/33
# fixtures distinct. Correctness reproduces 0/0/0 and 0/9/3 over 41,472 pixels,
# and 40.89 ms GPU-only / 968.45 ms wall at B=32 against notes/01's 39.79 /
# 952.45. Unpatched: rc=1, FileNotFoundError cells_8.bin.
#
# NOT FIXED HERE: probes/oc/run_oc.py --bench N has the identical blind
# `range(B)` load (line 93) and now works only because the recipe guarantees
# 33 fixtures. Its failure mode is identical and its guard is not shared.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

